# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true and a Linux checkout
# disagree about what "unchanged" means, shell scripts and Dockerfiles break
# when they gain a carriage return, and a PowerShell `>>` can silently turn a
# text file into UTF-16 that GitHub then renders as a binary blob.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The reference patches are compared byte-for-byte against regenerated output
# in CI; they must never be rewritten on checkout.
fixtures/reference_patches/*.diff text eol=lf -whitespace

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
